    "t": "Prepared for external exam revision | As per MR25 syllabus topics\nUNIT-I Complete Detailed Lecture Notes\n\nFigure 1. Unit-I roadmap for systematic external exam preparation.\nSyllabus Coverage: Boolean algebra and logic gates; binary codes; binary storage and registers; binary logic; digital\nlogic gates; data representation; data types; complements; fixed-point representation; floating-point representation;\ndigital computers; block diagram; computer organization, design and architecture.\n\nPrescribed Textbooks: M. Morris Mano, Digital Design, Third Edition; M. Morris Mano, Computer System\nArchitecture, Third Edition.\n\nUse this material by writing definitions, diagrams, truth tables, examples and differences in the examination.",
