    "t": "Prepared for external exam revision | As per MR25 syllabus topics\nContents\n1. Introduction to Unit-I\n2. Binary Codes\n3. Binary Storage and Registers\n4. Binary Logic\n5. Digital Logic Gates\n6. Boolean Algebra\n7. Data Representation\n8. Complements\n9. Fixed-Point Representation\n10. Floating-Point Representation\n11. Digital Computers\n12. Block Diagram of Digital Computer\n13. Working of a Digital Computer\n14. Computer Organization, Design and Architecture\n15. Exam-Oriented Short Notes\n16. Important Long-Answer Questions\n17. Quick Revision Points",
    "ocr": false
