    "p": 31,
    "t": "Register Transfer & -operations\nComputer Organization\nComputer Architectures Lab\nHARDWARE  IMPLEMENTATION  OF  LOGIC MICROOPERATIONS\n0    0     F = A B          AND\n0    1     F = A  B           OR\n1    0     F = A B          XOR\n1    1     F = A’           Complement\nS1 S0\nOutput\n-operation\nFunction table\nLogic Microoperations\nB\nA\nS\nS\nF\ni\ni\ni\n4 X 1\nMUX\nSelect",
