    "t": "(x + y)n =\nn\nj\n\n \n\n \nj =0\nn\n\nx n−jy j\nWhat is the coefficient of a8b9 in the expansion of (3a +2b)17?\nWhat is n?\nWhat is j?\nWhat is x?\n3a\nWhat is y?\n2b\n\n \n\n  (3a)8(2b)9 = 17\n\n \n\n  3829a8b9",
